"""pverestore - restore a VM from old disk images (filer snapshot or directory) into a new VM.

Copies every disk as a flat image: internal qcow2 snapshots and backing chains do not survive. The source is
only read; the original VM is only touched with --replace, which overwrites its disks in place. Runs on a PVE
node as root via pvesh. Stdlib only, Python >= 3.9.
"""
